## Commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm build        # tsup → dist/functions/
pnpm start        # func start (requires built output)
pnpm dev          # tsup --watch & func start (requires Azure Functions Core Tools)
pnpm test         # vitest
pnpm lint         # biome check
pnpm typecheck    # tsc --noEmit
pnpm deploy:staging
```

## Branching

- `staging` — working branch, deploys to staging on push
- `main` — production, deploys to prod (manual / required reviewers)

